      <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.35; margin-bottom: 18px;">Statutory RTO Paperwork, Transit Marine Insurance &amp; Delivery Handover for Bike Transport from Chennai</h2>
      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>Relocating your vehicle from Chennai to Bangalore is a seamless, two-day transit journey, but the success of your move depends entirely on the accuracy of your documentation. To ensure a smooth handover and avoid unnecessary delays at transit camps or the final delivery point, it is crucial to prepare the correct legal and administrative paperwork.</p>
<p>Meticulous preparation not only protects your asset but also provides the necessary proof for any potential insurance claims.</p>
<h3>Essential Documentation Checklist</h3>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self-attested RC Photocopy:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Registration Certificate is the primary legal document for your vehicle. Ensure you provide a clear, legible photocopy that has been self-attested by the owner. This document verifies your ownership and is strictly required for the transit permit.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Current PUC Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Pollution Under Control certificate must be valid on the day of pickup. An expired PUC can result in a temporary halt in the transit process, so verify the validity date well in advance.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">While standard insurance provides basic liability, the physical transit of your vehicle requires specific coverage. Verify that your policy is active and covers the entire duration of the Chennai-Bangalore route.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA-Approved Consignment Bilty:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">This is the official transport document issued by the logistics provider. It must be signed by both the owner and the transporter, detailing the vehicle's condition, model, and chassis number. This document acts as the legal receipt for your vehicle during transit.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<p>One of the most critical components of this paperwork is the inclusion of <strong>100% declared-value marine transit insurance</strong>. Standard car insurance often excludes transit damage or offers only a partial, limited coverage.</p>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">By opting for 100% declared-value marine transit insurance, you ensure that your vehicle is fully protected against any accidents, third-party damage, or mechanical failures that might occur during the 350-kilometer move.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This specific endorsement guarantees that the insurance payout matches the exact market value you declared, eliminating the risk of under-compensation in the unlikely event of a mishap.</span></li></ul>
<p>When your vehicle is loaded onto the enclosed trailer, the condition report on the IBA bilty must be cross-referenced with your own visual inspection. Ensure that any pre-existing scratches or dents are documented before the transport team signs off.</p>
<p>This level of transparency creates a clear baseline for the vehicle's condition, protecting you from post-transit disputes. By maintaining a comprehensive file containing these four essential documents, you empower yourself to manage the relocation process with confidence and total peace of mind.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>


